The contents of this directory are not distributed with the repository.
Rendered output of web-demo, generated on demand by a single click
(about 26 M per case; the vis job takes 1-2 h)

Restore: follow archives.tsv to download the package into archive/, then run ./archive/restore.sh
(This file is only a directory-skeleton placeholder; the "already in place" test in
restore.sh and setup.sh skips it.)
